finish({'A':20,'B':30,'C(i)':10,'C(ii)':20},[19,20,21,22,23,24,25],'The prompt contains no finite choose-k pool. Regulation and encouragement, the marketing elements, and the two management approaches are required headings, not alternatives. Government actions and aspects of facilitative management are open examples, so the illustrative support notes do not create extra routes.', ['Part C splits at the separate 10/20 scheme allocations.','Part A requires at least one regulation point and one encouragement point. Its unequal 7/7/6 tariffs are retained.','The scheme forbids repeating the same specific link within a section.','Scheme PDF pages are three greater than printed numbers.'])
